{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new customizable Shopify theme section called “Split Conversion Hero”.
    
    Purpose:
    This section will be used for landing pages that promote downloadable resources, checklists, assessments, guides, and demo-related offers. It should feel clean, premium, calm, and conversion-focused. The design should work well for a B2B retail analytics / retail intelligence company.
    
    Layout:
    Create a responsive two-column hero section with one text column and one image column.
    
    The merchant should be able to choose whether the image appears on the left or the right on desktop.
    
    On mobile, the section should stack cleanly. Add a setting to choose mobile order:
    
    * Text first
    * Image first
    
    Text column fields:
    Include customizable fields for:
    
    * Eyebrow text
    * Heading
    * Rich text description
    * Optional bullet list with up to 4 bullet items
    * Primary button label
    * Primary button link
    * Optional secondary button label
    * Optional secondary button link
    * Small caption / reassurance text below the button area
    
    Text column behavior:
    The heading should be large and clear.
    The description should support rich text.
    The bullet list should be optional. If no bullet items are entered, the bullet list should not display.
    The secondary button should only display if both the label and link are entered.
    The caption should only display if text is entered.
    
    Image column fields:
    Include:
    
    * Image picker
    * Image alt text
    * Image position control: left or right on desktop
    * Image aspect ratio options:
    
      * Natural
      * 4:3
      * 3:2
      * 1:1
      * Portrait
    * Image fit options:
    
      * Cover
      * Contain
    * Image border radius control
    * Image shadow on/off
    * Image border on/off
    * Optional image background panel on/off
    
    Optional trust strip:
    Add an optional small trust strip below the hero copy or below the buttons. It should support up to 4 short text items, such as:
    
    * Free PDF
    * For retail teams
    * 5-minute checklist
    * No obligation
    
    If no trust strip items are entered, this area should not display.
    
    Section style controls:
    Include settings for:
    
    * Section background color
    * Text color
    * Heading color
    * Eyebrow color
    * Accent color
    * Button background color
    * Button text color
    * Secondary button color
    * Image panel background color
    * Maximum section width
    * Top padding
    * Bottom padding
    * Column gap
    * Desktop column width:
    
      * 50/50
      * 55/45 text/image
      * 45/55 text/image
    * Vertical alignment:
    
      * Top
      * Center
    
    Design direction:
    The section should feel like a polished B2B SaaS landing page, not an ecommerce product section.
    Use generous spacing, clean typography, soft rounded corners, restrained shadows, and clear hierarchy.
    Avoid visual clutter.
    Avoid decorative overlays that make text harder to read.
    The image should feel intentionally placed inside the layout, not like a heavy full-width banner.
    The CTA area should be clear and easy to scan.
    
    Responsive behavior:
    On desktop, display the two columns side by side.
    On tablet and mobile, stack the columns with comfortable spacing.
    Buttons should stack or wrap naturally on small screens.
    Image should scale cleanly without cropping important content.
    Text should remain readable and not become cramped.
    
    Accessibility:
    Use semantic HTML where possible.
    Ensure buttons are accessible links.
    Use the image alt text field.
    Maintain readable contrast between text and background.
    Do not display empty elements when optional fields are blank.
    
    Default content:
    Eyebrow: Free Retail Checklist
    Heading: Find the store execution gaps that are costing you sales
    Description: Use this checklist to review how your stores measure traffic, understand conversion, and turn operational data into action.
    Bullet 1: Review traffic and conversion visibility
    Bullet 2: Identify missed operational signals
    Bullet 3: Align store teams around clearer daily actions
    Primary button: Download the checklist
    Caption: Free resource for retail leaders, store operations teams, and DX managers.
    Trust item 1: Free PDF
    Trust item 2: Retail operations focused
    Trust item 3: Practical checklist
    Trust item 4: No obligation
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-split-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 20px;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;
    align-items: {{ block.settings.vertical_alignment }};
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.column_ratio == '50-50' %}
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      {% elsif block.settings.column_ratio == '55-45' %}
        grid-template-columns: 1.22fr 1fr;
      {% elsif block.settings.column_ratio == '45-55' %}
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.22fr;
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}--image-left {
      direction: rtl;
    }

    .ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}--image-left > * {
      direction: ltr;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}--text-first .ai-split-hero-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 1;
    }

    .ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}--text-first .ai-split-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 2;
    }

    .ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}--image-first .ai-split-hero-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 2;
    }

    .ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}--image-first .ai-split-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 1;
    }
  }

  .ai-split-hero-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-split-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }

  .ai-split-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  .ai-split-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} p {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-bullets-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-bullet-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  .ai-split-hero-bullet-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-split-hero-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-split-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .ai-split-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_color }};
  }

  .ai-split-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
  }

  .ai-split-hero-caption-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-trust-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-top: 8px;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-trust-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-split-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    {% if block.settings.image_shadow %}
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.image_border %}
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-split-hero-image-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: -20px;
    left: -20px;
    right: -20px;
    bottom: -20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.image_panel_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius | plus: 8 }}px;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .ai-split-hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    {% if block.settings.image_aspect_ratio == 'natural' %}
      object-fit: {{ block.settings.image_fit }};
    {% elsif block.settings.image_aspect_ratio == '4-3' %}
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
      object-fit: {{ block.settings.image_fit }};
    {% elsif block.settings.image_aspect_ratio == '3-2' %}
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
      object-fit: {{ block.settings.image_fit }};
    {% elsif block.settings.image_aspect_ratio == '1-1' %}
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      object-fit: {{ block.settings.image_fit }};
    {% elsif block.settings.image_aspect_ratio == 'portrait' %}
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
      object-fit: {{ block.settings.image_fit }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-split-hero-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    {% if block.settings.image_aspect_ratio == 'natural' %}
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    {% elsif block.settings.image_aspect_ratio == '4-3' %}
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    {% elsif block.settings.image_aspect_ratio == '3-2' %}
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    {% elsif block.settings.image_aspect_ratio == '1-1' %}
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    {% elsif block.settings.image_aspect_ratio == 'portrait' %}
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-split-hero-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 300px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<split-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-split-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-split-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if block.settings.image_position == 'left' %}ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}--image-left{% endif %} ai-split-hero-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}--{{ block.settings.mobile_order }}">
      
      <div class="ai-split-hero-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}
          <p class="ai-split-hero-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h1 class="ai-split-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h1>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-split-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.description }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% assign has_bullets = false %}
        {% if block.settings.bullet_1 != blank or block.settings.bullet_2 != blank or block.settings.bullet_3 != blank or block.settings.bullet_4 != blank %}
          {% assign has_bullets = true %}
        {% endif %}

        {% if has_bullets %}
          <ul class="ai-split-hero-bullets-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.bullet_1 != blank %}
              <li class="ai-split-hero-bullet-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg class="ai-split-hero-bullet-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>{{ block.settings.bullet_1 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.bullet_2 != blank %}
              <li class="ai-split-hero-bullet-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg class="ai-split-hero-bullet-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>{{ block.settings.bullet_2 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.bullet_3 != blank %}
              <li class="ai-split-hero-bullet-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg class="ai-split-hero-bullet-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>{{ block.settings.bullet_3 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.bullet_4 != blank %}
              <li class="ai-split-hero-bullet-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg class="ai-split-hero-bullet-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>{{ block.settings.bullet_4 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
          </ul>
        {% endif %}

        <div>
          {% if block.settings.primary_button_label != blank and block.settings.primary_button_link != blank %}
            <div class="ai-split-hero-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <a href="{{ block.settings.primary_button_link }}" class="ai-split-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-split-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.primary_button_label }}
              </a>
              {% if block.settings.secondary_button_label != blank and block.settings.secondary_button_link != blank %}
                <a href="{{ block.settings.secondary_button_link }}" class="ai-split-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-split-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.secondary_button_label }}
                </a>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.caption != blank %}
            <p class="ai-split-hero-caption-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="margin-top: 16px;">{{ block.settings.caption }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        {% assign has_trust = false %}
        {% if block.settings.trust_1 != blank or block.settings.trust_2 != blank or block.settings.trust_3 != blank or block.settings.trust_4 != blank %}
          {% assign has_trust = true %}
        {% endif %}

        {% if has_trust %}
          <div class="ai-split-hero-trust-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.trust_1 != blank %}
              <div class="ai-split-hero-trust-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg class="ai-split-hero-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>{{ block.settings.trust_1 }}</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.trust_2 != blank %}
              <div class="ai-split-hero-trust-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg class="ai-split-hero-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>{{ block.settings.trust_2 }}</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.trust_3 != blank %}
              <div class="ai-split-hero-trust-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg class="ai-split-hero-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>{{ block.settings.trust_3 }}</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.trust_4 != blank %}
              <div class="ai-split-hero-trust-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg class="ai-split-hero-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>{{ block.settings.trust_4 }}</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-split-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.image_panel %}
          <div class="ai-split-hero-image-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="ai-split-hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.image_alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-split-hero-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</split-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class SplitHero{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
      }
    }

    customElements.define('split-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}', SplitHero{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

